    "description": "deskripsi",
    "Software Details": "Detail Perangkat Lunak",
    "A project can assign its task and bug to its team. A task overview and visual representation of project status can help you estimate progress on each task. Finally, you can check the top fixed function.": "Proyek dapat menugaskan tugas dan bug kepada tim. Ikhtisar tugas dan representasi visual status proyek membantu memperkirakan kemajuan setiap pekerjaan.",
    "/Month": "/Bulan",
    "/Year": "/Tahun",
    "Buy Now ": "Beli Sekarang ",
    "View Live Demo": "Lihat Demo Langsung",
    "MANAGE ALL YOUR PROJECTS AND PEOPLE": "KELOLA SEMUA PROYEK DAN ANGGOTA TIM ANDA",
    "Simple, yet powerful. Manage projects, work with clients, and collaborate with team members. All in one place.Create new projects and assign teams to each project. Add multiple members to share the projects with clients. You can edit permissions and controls to manage client access.": "Sederhana namun andal. Kelola proyek, bekerja bersama klien, dan berkolaborasi dengan anggota tim dalam satu tempat.",
    "Milestone and Gantt Chart manage": "Kelola Milestone dan Bagan Gantt",
    "Attach cost and summary to milestones and change the status through the drop-down menu. Get a tab on recent activities of a project and also a graph about progress. Along with that, you can check your tasks’ details under project details with the help of the Gantt Chart.": "Sematkan biaya dan ringkasan pada milestone serta pantau aktivitas dan kemajuan proyek dengan bantuan Bagan Gantt.",
    "Can collaborate with team members.": "Dapat berkolaborasi dengan anggota tim.",
    "Easily assign tasks, projects and milestones to team members. Exchange files and brainstorm ideas with your team. Can invite clients to discuss projects and deliver results.": "Tugaskan pekerjaan dengan mudah kepada tim, bertukar berkas, dan diskusikan proyek bersama klien.",
    "Easily Manage All Your Projects and Keep Your Business Growing.": "Kelola Semua Proyek Anda dengan Mudah dan Kembangkan Bisnis Anda.",
    "Got a big team or working on multiple projects at once? Manage task priorities or even create additional workspaces and use the built-in permission system to separate core projects. Make your team more effective by helping them avoid confusion ensuring they always know what to focus on.": "Kelola prioritas tugas di berbagai proyek sekaligus untuk memastikan tim selalu fokus pada hal terpenting.",
    "Kanban Task Management": "Manajemen Tugas Kanban",
    "Whether you need a simple tool to track your tasks, are a Kanban fan, want to create Gantt Charts or are looking for a convenient tool to track your projects - Taskly got you covered.": "Baik Anda membutuhkan pelacak tugas sederhana, papan Kanban, atau Bagan Gantt - modul ini siap memenuhi kebutuhan Anda.",
    "Simplify project tasks and sub-tasks": "Sederhanakan tugas dan sub-tugas proyek",
    "Add a new task to an already existing project and prioritize them according to the need of urgency. Assign the task to team members and set a due date for task completion. Add comments to the task and create a sub-task for ease of completion. Attach necessary files in a required task.": "Tambahkan tugas ke proyek, tentukan prioritas, batas waktu, komentar, dan lampirkan berkas yang diperlukan.",
    "Project task management": "Manajemen tugas proyek",
    "Create new tasks and assign users and priorities to them. You can write a note in the text box for the task description. Also, you can set the priority of each task through the priority dropdown.": "Buat tugas baru dan tetapkan pengguna serta prioritas dengan mudah.",
    "Project Milestone": "Milestone Proyek",
    "Go beyond short-term project management. Use project milestones to help you define and track progress towards long-term goals.": "Gunakan tonggak pencapaian (milestone) proyek untuk menentukan dan melacak kemajuan menuju target jangka panjang.",
    "Kanban Lyout": "Tata Letak Kanban",
    "Project tasks can be replaced by the Kanban drag system. Get a better visual overview of all your projects, tasks and assigned team members. Increase team productivity.": "Tugas proyek dapat dipindahkan dengan drag-and-drop pada papan Kanban untuk gambaran visual yang lebih jelas.",
    "Project Task Prioritization and milstone progress report": "Prioritas Tugas Proyek dan Laporan Kemajuan Milestone",
    "Project bug resoluation": "Penyelesaian Bug Proyek",
    "Create new bugs and assign users and priorities to them. You can write a note in the text box for the bug description. Also, the status of each bug can be changed through a simple drop-down and Kanban drag system.": "Catat bug baru, tugaskan penanggung jawab, dan pantau status perbaikannya.",
    "Why choose dedicated modules": "Mengapa memilih modul khusus",
    "for Your Business?": "untuk Bisnis Anda?",
    "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location.": "Dengan sistem ini, Anda dapat mengelola semua fungsi bisnis Anda dengan mudah dari satu lokasi.",
    "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Tingkatkan Kinerja Tenaga Kerja Anda",
    "Access over Premium Add-ons for Accounting, HR, Payments, Leads, Communication, Management, and more, all in one place!": "Akses Add-on Premium untuk Akuntansi, SDM, Pembayaran, Prospek, Komunikasi, Manajemen, dan lainnya di satu tempat!",
